   <p class="note">
      <span id="note-side"
         >1. It installs as <b>Discord Phoenix</b>, next to your normal Discord, and you sign in
         once.</span
      >
      <span id="note-replace" hidden>
         1. Uninstall Discord first if it came from the Play Store; Android won't update an app
         signed with a different key.
      </span>
