      2. Open the downloaded file and allow your browser to install apps if asked.<br>
      3. Later builds: just patch again. Builds are signed with Phoenix Unlock's key, rotated from
      the one earlier builds used, so it installs as an update over either (Android 9+) and you stay
      logged in.
